        "story_paragraph_1": "For the two sisters in India, their summer Sundays during childhood meant ‘swim-days’. Early morning pool sessions and plunges, followed by a hearty-brekkie meant the world to us. However, our sunny mornings were often clouded by the stressful bag packing where we barely managed to find ourselves suitable swims.",
